DTEND:20260719T090000
UID:0d46c522fb7cba1f526bc5b4c67df4fc@sonomavalleyevents.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a 2.5-mile guided walk along historic trails throu
 gh Beauty Ranch and down to the Wolf House ruins as we explore the trees t
 hat helped shape Jack London&rsquo\;s property and vision for the land. Al
 ong the way\, learn about London&rsquo\;s ambitious eucalyptus planting pr
 oject\, heritage orchard trees\, and other notable specimens that have bee
 n part of the ranch&rsquo\;s landscape for generations.
LOCATION:Jack London State Historic Park2400 London Ranch Rd Glen Ellen\, 
 CA 95442
URL:https://www.sonomavalleyevents.com/07/19/2026/historic-trees-of-beauty
 -ranch-hike/
