BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sonoma Creek Lower Headwaters Wildflower & Nature Hike
DTSTART:20260719T090000
DTEND:20260719T090000
UID:6ff41579863b9405312e78346fe5a95b@sonomavalleyevents.com
DESCRIPTION:Join retired professor Steve Hackett for a fun wildflower and 
 nature hike. Office hours without the office! Having bid farewell to sprin
 g\, we will be looking for summer-blooming species including larkspurs\, m
 onkeyflowers\, clarkias\, and lilies\, and we will discuss the ecology of 
 plant communities and how they respond to geology\, fire\, human intervent
 ions\, and pollinators. Our route on the Lower Bald Mountain\, Meadow\, Hi
 llside\, and Creekside Nature Trails highlights the park\\'s diverse lands
 capes 
LOCATION:Sugarloaf Ridge State Park2605 Adobe Canyon Road Kenwood\, CA 954
 52
URL:https://www.sonomavalleyevents.com/07/19/2026/sonoma-creek-lower-headw
 aters-wildflower-nature-hike/
X-SOURCE:Sonoma Valley Events
